### GET request to read all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users

### POST request to create a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "happy aaaaa",
    "role": "user",
    "email": "happy@exemple.com",
    "mobileNumber": "0123456789",
    "dob": "1990-11-11",
    "password": "abc123456"
}

### DELETE request to delete a user
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/69650ac2d4f7496c66727769

### POST login a user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/auth/cookie/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "somu@exemple.com",
    "password":"abc12345"
}

### POST Logout a user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/auth/cookie/logout

### cookies
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/auth/cookie/me
Content-Type: application/json



